adAt":"2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"1129529","title":"The Next Passage (Alternamorphs, #2)","author":"K.A. Applegate","url":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8985575730?utm_medium=api&utm_source=rss","coverUrl":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1375604644l/1129529._SX98_.jpg","rating":2,"readAt":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"42397849","title":"Burnout: The Secret to Unlocking the Stress Cycle","author":"Emily Nagoski","url":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8930830253?utm_medium=api&utm_source=rss","coverUrl":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1551216612l/42397849._SX98_.jpg","rating":2,"readAt":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}]},"mastodonPosts":[{"id":"117610104217151986","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117610104217151986","createdAt":"2026-11-13T16:36:11.872Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Watched A Few Good Men. M\u0010asterpiece of the early 90s, there are a lot of beautiful things Reiner did with the Navy/Marines dichotomy that I hadn’t intellectually noticed before. Sorkin writing is magical and each small part is played so well that it brings things to life.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/MovieReview\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>MovieReview</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117610104104302655","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/610/104/104/302/655/original/bbc6a406cbe39950.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/610/104/104/302/655/small/bbc6a406cbe39950.jpg","description":"Cruise and Moore sitting at a desk"}]},{"id":"117595877865941781","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117595877865941781","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:18:14.976Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>After really struggling with the hard parts of <a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/GameDev\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>GameDev</span></a> (marketing) over the past week, it was delightful to toss together a game in an evening with a kiddo from his mock-ups.</p>","media":[{"id":"117595877813200421","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/595/877/813/200/421/original/d6120ea6014ca881.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/595/877/813/200/421/small/d6120ea6014ca881.jpg","description":"A white surface holds a hand-drawn rectangle. Inside the rectangle, handwritten words read, 'creator Milo, co-creator mark, Ideas by milo and Emma.' Below the rectangle, the word 'back' is written."}]},{"id":"117584127722568888","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117584127722568888","createdAt":"2026-11-09T02:30:02.017Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Trying to figure out what capsule art looks like for Dot-Man is exhausting. I always figured that making a game was the hard part, but figuring out how to actually make it look fun (it PLAYS fun already) is its own skillset that I lack.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/GameDev\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>GameDev</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/Marketing\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>Marketing</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117584127588695459","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/584/127/588/695/459/original/869658c20fa5c431.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/584/127/588/695/459/small/869658c20fa5c431.jpg","description":"Dot-Man capsule art"}]},{"id":"117569998815531915","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117569998815531915","createdAt":"2026-11-06T14:36:52.008Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Any <a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/Disney\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>Disney</span></a> Fans out there who go to their food festivals? My wife just released an app to help people find the best food!</p><p><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/booths-bites/id6824773079\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">apps.apple.com/us/app/booths-b</span><span class=\"invisible\">ites/id6824773079</span></a></p>","media":[]},{"id":"117559402471044219","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117559402471044219","createdAt":"2026-11-04T17:42:04.619Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>I’m really loving the look and feel of the Frost Nova ability in Dot-Man. </p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/GameDev\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>GameDev</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117559401667696777","type":"gifv","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/559/401/667/696/777/original/76e01e9ff9370f44.mp4","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/559/401/667/696/777/small/76e01e9ff9370f44.png","description":"Frost Nova catching Mary in dot-man"}]}]},"__N_SSG":true}